rL/img.png?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&amp;expires=1790780399&amp;allow_ip=&amp;allow_referer=&amp;signature=HibXUWFEB911WFeWO02EnUQRL1o%3D\" srcset=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2F5Q6n9%2Fbtry1OkRwXr%2FAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKr4CUHte3QxocjREVmOXxGCoZiMh-_n1f1GmomajwrL%2Fimg.png%3Fcredential%3DyqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8%26expires%3D1790780399%26allow_ip%3D%26allow_referer%3D%26signature%3DHibXUWFEB911WFeWO02EnUQRL1o%253D\" width=\"554\"/></span><figcaption>Single-Cycle Failure</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<br/><b>Example #3 : Example #2와 달리 많은 색상이 나타났고, 이는 여러 Cycle이 실패하고 있음을 나타냄.</b><br/><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\" data-origin-height=\"328\" data-origin-width=\"557\"><span data-alt=\"Multiple Cycle Failure\" data-phocus=\"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxOBEg/btryY9QARD0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEVHAhqoA7JB6OcHJnF_UpXo4O49ExlNhELQifHC9ZXy/img.png?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&amp;expires=1790780399&amp;allow_ip=&amp;allow_referer=&amp;signature=15psKczruugluyP4ZmotOHSwedA%3D\" data-url=\"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxOBEg/btryY9QARD0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEVHAhqoA7JB6OcHJnF_UpXo4O49ExlNhELQifHC9ZXy/img.png?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&amp;expires=1790780399&amp;allow_ip=&amp;allow_referer=&amp;signature=15psKczruugluyP4ZmotOHSwedA%3D\"><img data-origin-height=\"328\" data-origin-width=\"557\" height=\"328\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png'; this.srcset='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png';\" src=\"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxOBEg/btryY9QARD0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEVHAhqoA7JB6OcHJnF_UpXo4O49ExlNhELQifHC9ZXy/img.png?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&amp;expires=1790780399&amp;allow_ip=&amp;allow_referer=&amp;signature=15psKczruugluyP4ZmotOHSwedA%3D\" srcset=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2FcxOBEg%2FbtryY9QARD0%2FAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEVHAhqoA7JB6OcHJnF_UpXo4O49ExlNhELQifHC9ZXy%2Fimg.png%3Fcredential%3DyqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8%26expires%3D1790780399%26allow_ip%3D%26allow_referer%3D%26signature%3D15psKczruugluyP4ZmotOHSwedA%253D\" width=\"557\"/></span><figcaption>Multiple Cycle Failure</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote data-ke-style=\"style1\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">기술 발전으로 Chip의 Size는 크게 줄일 수 있었지만, Test 및 Debugging에는 많은 문제가 발생하고 있습니다. Shmoo는 설계 검증과 관련된 복잡한 문제를 해결하는 데 많은 도움이 될 수 있습니다. Shmoo Plot을 사용하여 버그를 빠르게 찾아내고 Process, 설계 및 Final Test 프로그램을 최적화할 수 있습니다.</span></blockquote></div>"
